# Agent model routing (founder 2026-08-03)

## Always Grok 4.5 high (`cursor-grok-4.5-high`)

| Agent / role | Why |
|---|---|
| `prd-agent` | Prompt, slice, and ledger quality |
| `epic-agent` | Ticket cut and completeness |
| `ticket-runner` | Implementation against acceptance |
| Verifier / judge / independent re-check | Catch weak Composer answers |

When a Composer (or any research) result looks thin, low-confidence, or contradicts repo law: **re-run the check with Grok 4.5 high** and prefer its verdict.

## Composer 2.5 (`composer-2.5`) — research only

Use for: explore, web search, source gathering, parallel file maps, "unsure where is X" scans, other non-decision heavy gather work.

Do **not** use Composer for PRD/epic/ticket-runner or for final verify/close decisions.
